OL,3,GNEWSAFens reservoir earthworks trials
OL,4,Aproposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FGround testing works could begin as
OL,7,Fearly as next year on the site of a
OL,8,F#2.2bn reservoir in the Fens.
OL,10,FAnglian Water and Cambridge Water are
OL,11,Fplanning to build the 1.9 sq m (5 sq
OL,12,Fkm) lake north of Chatteris,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire.
OL,15,FA consultation for people to share
OL,16,Ftheir views on the earthworks trials,
OL,17,Fwhich would test construction methods,
OL,18,Fwill close on 9 December.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
